l},{"k":"27:24","t":"I found her and her people prostrating to the sun instead of Allāh, and Satan has made their deeds pleasing to them and averted them from [His] way, so they are not guided,","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"27:25","t":"[And] so they do not prostrate to Allāh, who brings forth what is hidden within the heavens and the earth and knows what you conceal and what you declare -","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"27:26","t":"Allāh - there is no deity except Him, Lord of the Great Throne.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":26,"sd":8},{"k":"27:27","t":"[Solomon] said, \"We will see whether you were truthful or were of the liars.","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"27:28","t":"Take this letter of mine and deliver it to them. Then leave them and see what [answer] they will return.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"27:29","t":"She said, \"O eminent ones, indeed, to me has been delivered a noble letter.","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"27:30","t":"Indeed, it is from Solomon, and indeed, it is [i.e., reads]: 'In the name of Allāh, the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful,","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"27:31","t":"Be not haughty with me but come to me in submission [as Muslims].'\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"27:32","t":"She said, \"O eminent ones, advise me in my affair. I would not decide a matter until you witness [for] me.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"27:33","t":"They said, \"We are men of strength and of great military might, but the command is yours, so see what you will command.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"27:34","t":"She said, \"Indeed kings - when they enter a city, they ruin it and render the honored of its people humbled. And thus do they do.","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"27:35","t":"But indeed, I will send to them a gift and see with what [reply] the messengers will return.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":27,"a":35,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[27],"sajdah":true}